tests/test_papersim_evaluation.py
1: """FX-11 paper-sim evaluation module tests.
2: 
3: Covers the M1 FX-11 node contract (docs/handoffs/2026-11-12-audit
4: 03-fix-list.md FX-11; re-reviewed M1 plan section `FX-11：净指标、全候选
5: 评分与已批准规则`):
6: 
7: - pure per-queue (model + market_type + gate version) metrics: counts,
8:   gross / two-sided-fee net ROI with clustered fixed-seed bootstrap,
9:   CLV, hit rate / average fill price, Brier / log loss, paired
10:   model-minus-market intervals, calibration, profit concentration,
11:   max drawdown;
12: - all-candidate scoring that is NOT conditioned on entry or settlement
13:   (all-rejected zero-entry queues still compare model vs market),
14:   actual-entry CLV / trade ROI strictly separated from unentered
15:   market-move diagnostics, UNKNOWN / INSUFFICIENT coverage instead of
16:   fabricated rows, zero-filled gaps, or rejections counted as losses;
17: - OD-G promotion criteria A-F (registered 2026-11-13 numbers) and the
18:   blueprint / FX-17 pause rules as suggestion output only;
19: - historical regression on the frozen 10-30 snapshot fixture
20:   (docs/paper-sim/review-2026-10-30/settled_ledger.json): gross 23.30%,
21:   top-market share 51.1%, excluding-top-market 12.22%, Brier 0.1873 vs
22:   0.2082, original bootstrap tolerance +/-1.5 percentage points.
23:   Historical regression, NOT v2-corrected performance.
24: """
25: 
26: from __future__ import annotations
27: 
