310: class _StubStoreConn:
311:     """In-memory stand-in speaking only the evaluate SELECT surface.
312: 
313:     Candidate rows carry the settlement-join columns of the fixed
314:     candidates query (``has_order_book`` plus the ``papersim.settlements``
315:     fields; ``None`` when no entry/settlement row exists) so one stub
316:     serves the whole evaluate surface.
317:     """
