1: """FX-08 tests: the ``decide_entry`` single entry point and its reasons.
2: 
3: Regression anchors preserved through the new entry point (numbers
4: byte-frozen from the same fixtures the existing suites pin):
5: 
6: - ``#48`` Brentford-Forest O2.5 (``regression_gate_arithmetic.json``):
7:   entry VWAP 0.560, exec +7.42c gross / +6.19c net, worst +6.35c,
8:   spread 2.11c -- ACCEPTED at the $250 FULL_EDGE unit;
9: - ``BOU-LEE`` O2.5 (``regression_r23_soccer.json``): rejected for the
10:   true 6.09c variant spread;
11: - ``HOF-LYO`` (``regression_banned_path.json`` + the WP-P2a bridge
12:   fixtures): rejected without a bridge, conditionally eligible with
13:   the validated bridge at a fixed $150 (``CROSS_LEAGUE_ML_CLASS``).
14: 
15: FX-13 additions: terminal/touch record-type consistency, mandatory
16: ``yes_when`` through ``conservative_edges_for_terminal``, the
17: above-YES / below-NO mirror under symmetric quotes, replay-preserving
18: original-direction evidence, and the three frozen r19 touch anchors
19: passing through the touch path unchanged.
20: 
21: Exhaustiveness: the parametrized rejection matrix mutates one accepted
22: base per known reason id and proves the decision is never accepted
23: with that reason present -- together with the structure property
24: (accepted <=> reasons empty AND every step pass) this covers "any
25: required check failing forces rejection".
26: """
27: 
